      "key": "treehouse.lesson.house-connections.filters-camera.body",
      "source": "In a populated [Graph](clank://graph) view, apply a filter that names a facet and value from the generated facet list, and confirm the result set changes. Then use the camera gestures to zoom and pan.\n\n**Observable result:** the filter changes the result set, and accepted camera gestures change scale by at least 20% and pan at least 48 CSS pixels from the starting camera.",
      "placeholders": [],
      "kind": "structured-prose",
      "status": "live",
      "locations": [
        "src/openclank/treehouse_field_guide.py:738"
      ],
