      "key": "treehouse.lesson.house-connections.graph-modes.body",
      "source": "Open [Graph](clank://graph) on a corpus with at least two linked documents. View **Documents · links**, then switch to **Structure · headings and bullets**.\n\n**Observable result:** both modes show at least one actual node. Selecting two empty modes is not enough.",
