    {
      "key": "treehouse.lesson.house-connections.graph-modes.explanation",
      "source": "[Graph](clank://graph) has two document modes. **Documents · links** draws the edges between documents. **Structure · headings and bullets** draws the shape inside them. Galaxy is an optional third projection for tracks and events — a related destination, not a replacement for either. (An older name, Mind, referred to structure mode; it is not a separate launcher.)",
      "placeholders": [],
