    {
      "key": "treehouse.lesson.house-connections.research-compare.body",
      "source": "Open a research note and check that its claims carry source references. Open a Compare result and read the recorded selection and reason.\n\n**What is distinctive:** sources stay attached to the claim, and a comparison leaves a record rather than a vibe. Live inference is optional — recorded fixture responses are enough to learn the workflow, and reading this lesson never starts a paid call.",
      "placeholders": [],
      "kind": "structured-prose",
      "status": "live",
      "locations": [
