    },
    {
      "key": "treehouse.lesson.house-connections.research-compare.explanation",
      "source": "Research work keeps its sources. A research note records what came from where, so a claim can be checked. Compare sets two recorded responses side by side and records which you chose and why. Both are ordinary content you can open again.",
